  "body": "v1.12.1\r\n\r\nTicket activity\r\n- The ticket's Stats tab has an Activity section under Board: its events\r\n  and commits in the event log's own rows, the newest eight shown and\r\n  the rest behind \"N earlier\" (E2JW616)\r\n\r\nStats\r\n-  Gui styling\r\n\r\nFixes\r\n- Clicking a card's diff stat or comment count selects that card alone rather than adding it beside the card already selected\r\n\r\nDocs\r\n- The readme shows the current GUI"
